cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the MoleditPy application it extends."
type: software
title: "MoleditPy MCP Server Plugin"
abstract: "An MCP (Model Context Protocol) server plugin for MoleditPy that exposes the molecular editor to AI assistants. Enables molecule loading, editing, 3D visualization, DFT input file generation, and plugin authoring via natural-language conversation."
authors:
